{"seq":3,"slug":"scan-methods","title":"扫描方式与场序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/scan-methods","wordCount":1082,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"扫描方式与场序\">扫描方式与场序</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>扫描方式（Scan Method）定义了视频帧如何被&quot;绘制&quot;到屏幕上——是一次性显示完整帧（逐行扫描，Progressive）还是分两次交替显示奇偶行（隔行扫描，Interlaced）。这一源自 CRT 时代的技术遗产至今仍在广播和某些专业领域存在，理解它对于视频转换、去隔行处理和档案修复都至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Scan Methods&lt;br/&gt;扫描方式&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Progressive (p)&lt;br/&gt;逐行扫描&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Interlaced (i)&lt;br/&gt;隔行扫描&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;每帧完整&lt;br/&gt;1080p = 1080行/帧&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;每场半帧&lt;br/&gt;1080i = 540行/场 × 2&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;时间分辨率高&lt;br/&gt;60场/秒 = 运动流畅&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Scan Methods&lt;br/&gt;扫描方式\"] --&gt; B[\"Progressive (p)&lt;br/&gt;逐行扫描\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Interlaced (i)&lt;br/&gt;隔行扫描\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"每帧完整&lt;br/&gt;1080p = 1080行/帧\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"每场半帧&lt;br/&gt;1080i = 540行/场 × 2\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"时间分辨率高&lt;br/&gt;60场/秒 = 运动流畅\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>逐行扫描（Progressive）</strong>：每帧一次性绘制全部行，无时间交织，是现代视频的通用标准。</li>\n<li><strong>隔行扫描（Interlaced）</strong>：将每帧拆为两个场交替显示，以半带宽换取更高的时间分辨率，源自 CRT 时代。</li>\n<li><strong>场（Field）</strong>：隔行帧的奇/偶行集合，场率为帧率的两倍，是广播时间分辨率的基础。</li>\n<li><strong>去隔行（Deinterlacing）</strong>：将隔行素材转为逐行的过程，从简单的 Bob/Weave 到运动补偿的 QTGMC、AI 方案。</li>\n<li><strong>PsF（逐行分段帧）</strong>：逐行内容以隔行方式传输，合并两场即可无损还原。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"隔行扫描原理\">隔行扫描原理</h2><h3 id=\"crt-时代的带宽妥协\">CRT 时代的带宽妥协</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>带宽</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>fps</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>bit depth</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{带宽} = W \\times H \\times \\text{fps} \\times \\text{bit depth}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">带宽</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fps</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bit depth</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>1950 年代的电视系统带宽有限——要在有限带宽下实现流畅运动和足够分辨率，隔行扫描将每帧分为两个&quot;场&quot;（Field）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>帧 (Frame)</td>\n<td>完整画面（全部行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上场 (Top Field)</td>\n<td>奇数行 (1, 3, 5...)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下场 (Bottom Field)</td>\n<td>偶数行 (2, 4, 6...)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场率</td>\n<td>每秒场数（NTSC: 59.94, PAL: 50）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帧率</td>\n<td>场率/2（NTSC: 29.97, PAL: 25）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"隔行扫描的优缺点\">隔行扫描的优缺点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>带宽减半（同帧率）</td>\n<td>运动场景出现&quot;梳齿&quot;伪影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间分辨率高（场率 = 2×帧率）</td>\n<td>静止画面分辨率等效逐行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兼容老设备</td>\n<td>现代显示器需去隔行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广播标准支持</td>\n<td>后期处理复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"逐行扫描\">逐行扫描</h2><h3 id=\"现代标准\">现代标准</h3><p>逐行扫描在每帧绘制完整的所有行——没有时间交织问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标准</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>像素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>720p</td>\n<td>1280×720 Progressive</td>\n<td>每帧完整 720 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1080p</td>\n<td>1920×1080 Progressive</td>\n<td>每帧完整 1080 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2160p (4K)</td>\n<td>3840×2160 Progressive</td>\n<td>每帧完整 2160 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4320p (8K)</td>\n<td>7680×4320 Progressive</td>\n<td>每帧完整 4320 行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"逐行的普及\">逐行的普及</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>2025年</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>几乎所有新内容</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>逐行扫描</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{2025年}: \\text{几乎所有新内容} = \\text{逐行扫描}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2025</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">几乎所有新内容</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">逐行扫描</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>领域</th>\n<th>扫描方式</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网络视频</td>\n<td>100% 逐行</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流媒体</td>\n<td>100% 逐行</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字电影</td>\n<td>100% 逐行</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广播电视</td>\n<td>混合（转向逐行）</td>\n<td>过渡中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控</td>\n<td>逐行为主</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>档案/老素材</td>\n<td>隔行</td>\n<td>需转换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"去隔行处理-deinterlacing\">去隔行处理（Deinterlacing）</h2><h3 id=\"算法类型\">算法类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bob</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>每场拉伸为全帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>直接合并两场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blend</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>两场混合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Yadif</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>自适应方向插值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QTGMC</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>运动补偿时域滤波</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI (RIFE/SVP)</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>慢(GPU)</td>\n<td>深度学习运动估计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"去隔行的关键决策\">去隔行的关键决策</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;隔行素材&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;内容类型？&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;静态为主&quot;| C[&quot;Weave/场合并&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;运动为主&quot;| D[&quot;Yadif/QTGMC&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;混合&quot;| E[&quot;自适应(Yadif)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F{&quot;输出帧率？&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;保持场率(60fps)&quot;| G[&quot;Bob + 插值&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;帧率(30fps)&quot;| H[&quot;标准去隔行&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"隔行素材\"] --&gt; B{\"内容类型？\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"静态为主\"| C[\"Weave/场合并\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"运动为主\"| D[\"Yadif/QTGMC\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"混合\"| E[\"自适应(Yadif)\"]\n    D --&gt; F{\"输出帧率？\"}\n    F --&gt;|\"保持场率(60fps)\"| G[\"Bob + 插值\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"帧率(30fps)\"| H[\"标准去隔行\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"psf-progressive-segmented-frame\">PsF（Progressive Segmented Frame）</h2><h3 id=\"逐行分段帧\">逐行分段帧</h3><p>PsF 是一种特殊格式——内容是逐行拍摄的，但以隔行方式传输/存储：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PsF</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>逐行内容</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>隔行封装</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PsF} = \\text{逐行内容} + \\text{隔行封装}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PsF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">逐行内容</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">隔行封装</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>PsF</th>\n<th>真隔行</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拍摄方式</td>\n<td>逐行</td>\n<td>隔行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动伪影</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有（梳齿）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输方式</td>\n<td>分两场传输</td>\n<td>分两场传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复方式</td>\n<td>简单合并两场</td>\n<td>需去隔行算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>24p 通过 SDI 传输</td>\n<td>广播</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用场景\">实际应用场景</h2><h3 id=\"广播标准现状-2025-2026\">广播标准现状（2025-2026）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>地区</th>\n<th>标准</th>\n<th>过渡状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>DTMB: 1080i/1080p</td>\n<td>CCTV 转向 4K 逐行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日本</td>\n<td>ISDB: 4K/8K 逐行</td>\n<td>已部署 BS4K/BS8K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧洲</td>\n<td>DVB-T2: 1080p</td>\n<td>逐步全面逐行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>ATSC 3.0: 4K 逐行</td>\n<td>部署中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新制作内容</td>\n<td>始终逐行 (p)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>老素材数字化</td>\n<td>保留原始 → 高质量去隔行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直播输出</td>\n<td>按平台要求（逐行优先）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>档案保存</td>\n<td>保留原始格式不做转换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>扫描方式是视频技术从模拟到数字过渡中最重要的&quot;遗产问题&quot;——理解它对处理老素材、广播接口和格式转换都至关重要。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扫描方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>现状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隔行 (i)</td>\n<td>低带宽高时间分辨率</td>\n<td>运动伪影、后期复杂</td>\n<td>逐步淘汰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐行 (p)</td>\n<td>无伪影、后期友好</td>\n<td>带宽需求高</td>\n<td>现代标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PsF</td>\n<td>兼容传输+逐行内容</td>\n<td>特殊设备</td>\n<td>专业接口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"扫描方式与场序","id":"扫描方式与场序"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"隔行扫描原理","id":"隔行扫描原理"},{"level":3,"text":"CRT 时代的带宽妥协","id":"crt-时代的带宽妥协"},{"level":3,"text":"隔行扫描的优缺点","id":"隔行扫描的优缺点"},{"level":2,"text":"逐行扫描","id":"逐行扫描"},{"level":3,"text":"现代标准","id":"现代标准"},{"level":3,"text":"逐行的普及","id":"逐行的普及"},{"level":2,"text":"去隔行处理（Deinterlacing）","id":"去隔行处理-deinterlacing"},{"level":3,"text":"算法类型","id":"算法类型"},{"level":3,"text":"去隔行的关键决策","id":"去隔行的关键决策"},{"level":2,"text":"PsF（Progressive Segmented Frame）","id":"psf-progressive-segmented-frame"},{"level":3,"text":"逐行分段帧","id":"逐行分段帧"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用场景","id":"实际应用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"广播标准现状（2025-2026）","id":"广播标准现状-2025-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"分辨率与像素密度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/resolution"},"next":{"title":"H.264/H.265 编码架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs/h264-h265"}}